      "content": "hey quick question my kid is sick and the doctor prescribed amoxicillin liquid but i'm so confused with the math. the bottle says 400mg/5ml and kid is 15kg. the doctor said 40mg per kg per day. how many mL should i give him each dose?? he needs it twice a day",
